              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avandu vi ihiiri ya Rubeni na Gadi vavoola, “Uvwali yivu voveeye kelolero ku kunyi kwosi ndi Yahova aveeye Nyasaye.” Kunangwa vavugulika “Lilolekiza”.",
